  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Toss broccoli with olive oil, a pinch of salt, and pepper; spread on a baking sheet.",
    "Roast broccoli for 12–15 minutes until edges are crisp.",
    "While broccoli roasts, lightly toast pita slices over medium heat for 1–2 minutes on each side until warm.",
    "Whisk together lemon juice, low-sodium soy sauce, sumac, cumin, coriander, and pomegranate molasses in a bowl.",
    "Place roasted broccoli evenly on each pita.",
    "Drizzle the sauce over the broccoli, then top with mint, parsley, and crushed chickpeas.",
    "Fold the pita into a wrap shape and serve immediately."
